 "hypothesis": "H75-1 (DCHB-CG): Five strictly catalogue-free hydrogeologic, radiometric, transtensional-shear, and flight-line-destriped potential-field operators (H75_darcy_seepage_barrier, H75_uth_sinter_emergence, H75_oblique_piedmont_inflection, H75_riedel_obliquity_shear, H75_destriped_blakely_contact) coupled via a frozen gamma=0.60 Corridor-Gated Dual-Regime multiplicative gate (M_corridor^0.60 * M_trace^0.40 on L_valid=1; quantile-calibrated M_corridor^0.60 * M_gap^0.40 on the 24.66% L_valid=0 3DEP gap) recover unmapped Great Basin geothermal fault systems while suppressing Pleistocene shoreline benches, isolated volcanic-tableland cliffs, and Family-B LiDAR scarp convergence.",
 "mechanism": "1) Directed 3-km Darcy piezometric groundwater seepage impinging on smectite fault-gouge MT aquitard steps (cond_surf) and basement steps (depth_to_base_surf). 2) Authigenic carbonate/sinter U/Th ridge (Thorium-immobile normalized) gated by GDR 1391 quartz-enthalpy hydrothermal upflow (dist_known_fault_px strictly excluded). 3) Cross-contour sin^2(theta_mic - theta_mac) shoreline deconfounder vanishing on contour-parallel Lake Lahontan/Bonneville wave-cut benches. 4) +-17 deg Byerlee Riedel R-shear resonance along 1.5-km basement corridors weighted by Kreemer geodetic shear strain. 5) 2-D directional Gaussian flight-line-destriped RTP + TMI_up150 + Bouguer Blakely-Simpson contact spine. Coupled across 3 LOQO experts (54/83/70 cols).",
 "named_non_fault_mimic": "Unfaulted Tertiary volcanic-front permeability pinch-outs, perched travertine/uraniferous caliche aprons down-gradient of cold carbonate springs, Pleistocene Lake Lahontan/Bonneville gravel-spit cusps and deltaic foreset toes cutting obliquely across piedmont contours, and dipping Mesozoic pluton/roof-pendant intrusive contacts.",
